-zixiang:p005","quote":"臨死，啓上曰：「劉寅等入齋檢仗，具如前啓。臣罪旣山海，分甘斧鉞。奉勑遣胡諧之、茹法亮賜重勞，其等至，竟無宣旨，便建旗入津，對城南岸築城守。臣累遣書信喚法亮渡，乞白服相見，其永不肯，羣小懼怖，遂致攻戰，此臣之罪也。臣此月二十五日束身投軍，希還天闕，停宅一月，臣自取盡，可使齊代無殺子之譏，臣免逆父之謗。旣不遂心，今便命盡，臨啓哽塞，知復何陳。」有司奏絕子響屬籍，削爵土，收付廷尉法獄治罪。賜爲蛸氏。諸所連坐，別下考論。贈劉寅侍中，席恭穆輔國將軍、益州刺史，江愈、殷曇粲黃門郎，周彥驍騎將軍。寅字景蕤，高平人也。有文義而學不閑世務。席恭穆，安定焉氏人，關隴豪族。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"surname":"劉","work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-040","source_id":"s-nanqishu-040-zixiang-ws2272748"}],"life_events":[{"id":"le-nanqi040-zixiang-officer1","person_id":"zoy_74m_fbk","event_type":"death","source_term":"殺","source_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p003","surface":"殺","start":223,"end":224},"date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-040","source_id":"s-nanqishu-040-zixiang-ws2272748","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p003","quote":"七年，遷使持節、都督荊湘雍梁寧南北秦七州軍事、鎮軍將軍、荊州刺史。子響少好武，在西豫時，自選帶仗左右六十人，皆有膽幹。至鎮，數在內齋殺牛置酒，與之聚樂。令內人私作錦袍絳襖，欲餉蠻交易器仗。長史劉寅等連名密啓，上勑精檢。寅等懼，欲秘之。子響聞臺使至，不見勑，召寅及司馬席恭穆、諮議參軍江愈、殷曇粲、中兵參軍周彥、典籤吳脩之、王賢宗、魏景淵於琴臺下詰問之。寅等無言。脩之曰：「旣以降勑旨，政應方便答塞。」景淵曰：「故應先檢校。」子響大怒，執寅等於後堂殺之。以啓無江愈名，欲釋之，而用命者已加戮。上聞之怒，遣衞尉胡諧之、游擊將軍尹略、中書舍人茹法亮領齋仗數百人，檢捕羣小。勑：「子響若束首自歸，可全其性命。」","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p003:m0096"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"承琴臺下八人名單，命殺於後堂；江愈不在連名密啓中，亦已被戮。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p003:m0096","surface":"劉寅","start":96,"end":98,"person_id":"zoy_74m_fbk","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p003","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p003:m0109","surface":"寅","start":109,"end":110,"person_id":"zoy_74m_fbk","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p003","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p003:m0129","surface":"寅","start":129,"end":130,"person_id":"zoy_74m_fbk","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p003","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p003:m0176","surface":"寅","start":176,"end":177,"person_id":"zoy_74m_fbk","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p003","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p003:m0218","surface":"寅","start":218,"end":219,"person_id":"zoy_74m_fbk","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p003","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005:m0008","surface":"劉寅","start":8,"end":10,"person_id":"zoy_74m_fbk","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005:m0209","surface":"劉寅","start":209,"end":211,"person_id":"zoy_74m_fbk","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005:m0244","surface":"寅","start":244,"end":245,"person_id":"zoy_74m_fbk","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005:m0246","surface":"景蕤","start":246,"end":248,"person_id":"zoy_74m_fbk","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-nanqi040-zixiang-m3-94-劉寅","person_id":"zoy_74m_fbk","title":"長史","kind":"o